me for Hecate?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes. &quot;Tri Via&quot; = Three Roads. Goddess of Crossroads.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T16:02:27-07:00","id":1086373,"title":"","content":"<b>A Scion of Quetzalcotl</b> who works in the robotics industry, designing artificial replacements for failing body parts. Their journey finally culminates in the singularity of man and machine, with the Scion taking their place as a <i>God of Functionality.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>A Scion of Hephaestus</b> who works as a military engineer, constructing defensive forts to hold off the enemy. Over the course of their adventures, they are commissioned by Olympus to shore up their defensive positions in the war against the Titans. By the end of their journey, they succeed in becoming the <i>God of Fortifications.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>A Scion of Ptah</b> who designs puzzle solving games before implementing the most difficult ones into architectural projects. The goal is to leave her pantheon's enemies so frustrated that they eventually give up and leave without having to fight them. She eventually becomes the <i>Goddess of Security</i>, known for creating systems that are equally fun and infuriating!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T21:46:01-07:00","id":1088100,"title":"","content":"<b>A Scion of Lucifer </b>who is a half-saudi guy who just graduated college and found himself stuck back in his hometown in bumfuck, Alabama. Father was killed in a hate crime back in '01 and ever since then his mom's been out of the picture and just going through the motions. He's felt he's had to work thrice as hard as the guy next to him just to feel valid or get any sort of recognition from his mother.<br /> <br /> Excelled in speech and track in high school, but kicked off both teams because most of the team didn't really cooperate with him around. Went through 5 years and got a business degree he doesn't really care for, flew back home because mother's health is failing and he wants to set her up in a assisted living facility.<br /> <br /> And that's when he finds everything out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T14:09:39-07:00","id":1088485,"title":"","content":"She's a student of religions and runs an occult book shop, more of an academic than a believer. That's why she's as surprised as anyone when Baphomet appears and reveals her heritage... something she vehemently objects to. <br /> <br /> &quot;You're one of the least-real gods out there! You were made up!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T16:54:31-07:00","id":1088554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/921296-what-are-your-character-concepts?p=1088485#post1088485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She's a student of religions and runs an occult book shop, more of an academic than a believer. That's why she's as surprised as anyone when Baphomet appears and reveals her heritage... something she vehemently objects to.<br /> <br /> &quot;You're one of the least-real gods out there! You were made up!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That sounds very, very familiar. Was it posted in another thread around here, somewhere?<br /> <br /> <br /> -------------------------------------<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>A Scion of Hastur</b> who offers his skills and expertise for profit. He has a habit of giving out business cards to people, saying that if they ever need his help, they only have to call him!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","n